WEBVTT

00:00:26.250 --> 00:00:32.209
[Full-Time Magister 2]

00:00:34.218 --> 00:00:37.371
♪ The rising dawn
cuts through the night ♪

00:00:37.625 --> 00:00:40.321
♪ And destroys the darkness ♪

00:00:40.420 --> 00:00:44.407
♪ A new wing shall emerge ♪

00:00:44.861 --> 00:00:48.043
♪ And soar through the sky ♪

00:00:48.873 --> 00:00:52.215
♪ Smoke appears
in conflicted dimensions ♪

00:00:52.527 --> 00:00:55.165
♪ Waiting for someone's arrival ♪

00:00:55.547 --> 00:01:00.092
♪ Protecting the unshakable
belief within us ♪

00:01:00.332 --> 00:01:02.230
♪ And never backs down ♪

00:01:02.865 --> 00:01:06.729
♪ The sacred fountain lays there ♪

00:01:07.170 --> 00:01:10.491
♪ Shocked by what had appeared
in front of us ♪

00:01:10.877 --> 00:01:13.923
♪ The star atlas has open
a path for our journey ♪

00:01:14.078 --> 00:01:17.363
♪ Laughing while we watch
the world from above ♪

00:01:17.796 --> 00:01:20.898
♪ He had given me everything ♪

00:01:20.992 --> 00:01:25.076
♪ The truth in sight is unpleasant ♪

00:01:25.116 --> 00:01:27.838
♪ Anger that is insurmountable ♪

00:01:27.839 --> 00:01:32.247
♪ That unique soul
was born to be a hero ♪

00:01:32.390 --> 00:01:35.517
♪ The torrential rain can't be
stopped by the hot-blooded ♪

00:01:35.557 --> 00:01:39.442
♪ The chosen one will not
bid farewell easily ♪

00:01:39.464 --> 00:01:42.307
♪ I will create a miracle ♪

00:01:42.308 --> 00:01:47.844
♪ With the burning fire
in my wounded heart ♪

00:01:48.051 --> 00:01:52.142
♪ I promise ♪

00:02:00.378 --> 00:02:02.071
Come quickly!
I've discovered the entrance!

00:02:02.579 --> 00:02:03.379
Guo Caitang.

00:02:03.918 --> 00:02:07.960
Go and scout for the monsters' entrances
at Epigraph Girls Junior High.

00:02:09.373 --> 00:02:10.267
Yes.

00:02:13.971 --> 00:02:17.112
Is this the entrance?

00:02:20.635 --> 00:02:21.898
Help!

00:02:28.664 --> 00:02:31.551
-There's a survivor?
-She's lucky.

00:02:36.627 --> 00:02:37.382
Xiaoke.

00:02:37.421 --> 00:02:38.991
-I'll leave the girl to you.
-Okay.

00:02:43.224 --> 00:02:44.213
It's calling for reinforcements.

00:02:44.511 --> 00:02:47.339
We must do it now!
We can't wait any longer!

00:02:47.352 --> 00:02:49.086
We need to seal the monsters' entrances!

00:02:49.139 --> 00:02:51.668
If not, more monsters
will get into the city!

00:02:52.256 --> 00:02:53.604
Everyone, attack!

00:03:31.125 --> 00:03:33.001
We can't let them get into Bow City!

00:03:49.667 --> 00:03:51.168
How's the situation?

00:03:51.859 --> 00:03:53.471
They've broke through the ranks.

00:03:53.959 --> 00:03:57.585
But there are many One-eyed
Wolf monsters and Cyclops there.

00:03:58.231 --> 00:04:00.164
They can't reach
there in a short time.

00:04:00.765 --> 00:04:03.782
Is that so? Stay here and keep watch.

00:04:04.507 --> 00:04:06.334
Just stay here if you're afraid.

00:04:06.856 --> 00:04:08.070
I'll kill them all.

00:04:08.870 --> 00:04:12.097
I'll not let anyone survive!
I'm going now!

00:04:18.375 --> 00:04:20.126
This is not the path we should take!

00:04:22.809 --> 00:04:24.556
You're sending me
to the protective barrier?

00:04:24.973 --> 00:04:26.954
-I'm not going!
-I can't let you take the risk!

00:04:29.160 --> 00:04:30.160
Brother Mo Fan.

00:04:34.160 --> 00:04:37.531
This bridge is the only usable path.

00:04:38.206 --> 00:04:40.474
-What should we do now?
-This is bad!

00:04:50.354 --> 00:04:52.993
Brother Mo Fan.
It's following us!

00:04:53.143 --> 00:04:54.793
Damn it! Hold tight!

00:05:14.886 --> 00:05:16.113
Brother Mo Fan.

00:05:18.675 --> 00:05:20.501
That thing must be terrifying.

00:05:20.834 --> 00:05:23.001
I was almost killed by it.

00:05:23.529 --> 00:05:24.809
But it's a different monster.

00:05:25.303 --> 00:05:27.369
There's a Thorn-Faced Wolf here as well?

00:05:27.967 --> 00:05:31.742
I don't know how to defeat
a monster of this level.

00:05:32.553 --> 00:05:34.247
Ever since the disaster,

00:05:34.387 --> 00:05:36.200
I had always been hiding.

00:05:36.413 --> 00:05:37.573
I did nothing.

00:05:38.187 --> 00:05:42.107
But you had created a safe path
for the people of our school.

00:05:42.860 --> 00:05:46.127
And came out of your way to save me.

00:05:46.400 --> 00:05:48.680
I'm sure it's dangerous for you.

00:05:48.931 --> 00:05:49.731
And hard too.

00:05:50.118 --> 00:05:53.438
I know your feelings
when you're alone and helpless.

00:05:56.492 --> 00:05:59.123
Everyone is fragile and weak
in front of the disaster.

00:05:59.576 --> 00:06:02.363
I've seen too much on my way here.

00:06:06.198 --> 00:06:08.025
Are the others okay?

00:06:08.371 --> 00:06:10.811
Many people were unlucky.

00:06:23.068 --> 00:06:26.504
Damn it!
There's no end to them!

00:06:27.435 --> 00:06:29.507
This is not the only entrance.
Let's move to the next.

00:06:30.128 --> 00:06:32.368
I thought I would face someone powerful.

00:06:32.461 --> 00:06:34.795
But it turns out to be weaklings.

00:06:36.965 --> 00:06:38.192
You overestimated your abilities.

00:06:40.548 --> 00:06:41.521
The Black Curia?

00:06:44.251 --> 00:06:45.157
You are...

00:06:45.827 --> 00:06:46.907
I think I've seen him before.

00:06:48.869 --> 00:06:50.255
A group of weaklings.

00:06:50.578 --> 00:06:52.951
You guys want to destroy the entrance?
You think too much.

00:06:53.871 --> 00:06:55.725
Just escape while you can.

00:06:56.965 --> 00:06:58.915
Since you guys
treated me well in the past,

00:06:59.373 --> 00:07:03.438
I'll let you guys off if you surrender
yourself to the Black Curia.

00:07:07.900 --> 00:07:08.980
You're Yu Ang?

00:07:09.382 --> 00:07:10.769
What happened to your face?

00:07:11.243 --> 00:07:12.923
The Mu Family treated you well.

00:07:13.161 --> 00:07:15.561
But in the end, you're an ingrate.

00:07:17.289 --> 00:07:18.795
Die!

00:07:43.307 --> 00:07:44.366
Damn it!

00:07:44.653 --> 00:07:47.266
They have more people than we do!

00:07:47.365 --> 00:07:49.605
I shouldn't be here!

00:07:49.818 --> 00:07:50.831
Where are you going?

00:08:01.687 --> 00:08:03.360
Don't get too cocky!

00:08:03.714 --> 00:08:04.767
Come, my beasts!

00:08:19.067 --> 00:08:22.437
Keep calm.
We must protect Bow City!

00:08:23.390 --> 00:08:25.901
We will surely be victorious!

00:08:50.898 --> 00:08:52.737
It's at the front!
Should we do it now?

00:09:19.605 --> 00:09:20.325
Damn it!

00:09:20.459 --> 00:09:22.352
It doesn't want to confront us directly.

00:09:23.077 --> 00:09:25.464
High-level monsters
are intelligent beings.

00:09:25.902 --> 00:09:29.083
Before we kill its servants,

00:09:29.230 --> 00:09:32.004
it won't waste its energy on us.

00:09:33.288 --> 00:09:34.728
If we fight with our best,

00:09:35.000 --> 00:09:37.334
we can kill all of its servants.

00:09:38.291 --> 00:09:40.162
I'm just afraid that there will
be more monsters around.

00:09:41.209 --> 00:09:44.043
The entrances of Epigraph Girls
Junior High is near to this place.

00:09:45.610 --> 00:09:46.757
We can't care about that now.

00:09:51.330 --> 00:09:53.476
You think too much!
Get out of my way!

00:09:56.999 --> 00:10:00.123
If you want to die, come at me!

00:10:26.139 --> 00:10:26.805
Leader.

00:10:26.917 --> 00:10:29.885
Reserve your mana
for the Pterolycus.

00:10:30.883 --> 00:10:33.558
We'll deal with the mobs.

00:10:34.222 --> 00:10:34.982
But...

00:10:35.624 --> 00:10:36.438
Leader!

00:10:36.547 --> 00:10:38.920
We treat Bow City as our home.

00:10:39.779 --> 00:10:41.806
We can sacrifice our lives for it.

00:10:42.571 --> 00:10:44.451
But only you can deal
with the Pterolycus.

00:10:44.813 --> 00:10:46.613
Before fighting it,

00:10:46.772 --> 00:10:48.572
please don't use any magic.

00:10:49.648 --> 00:10:51.506
Please leave the rest to us.

00:10:52.160 --> 00:10:53.133
Believe in us.

00:10:54.590 --> 00:10:55.710
Everyone, listen!

00:10:55.788 --> 00:10:57.948
Go forth and never look back!

00:10:58.247 --> 00:11:01.321
-Open a path for our leader!
-Go!

00:11:16.489 --> 00:11:18.808
Dirty monsters, die!

00:11:19.081 --> 00:11:20.748
Lightning Bolt!

00:11:48.792 --> 00:11:49.819
Go now!

00:11:50.109 --> 00:11:51.830
Please win for us!

00:13:32.658 --> 00:13:33.753
Zodiac magic!

00:13:34.955 --> 00:13:37.869
Heavenly Burial!

00:14:04.170 --> 00:14:06.537
That's Zodiac-level fire magic!
It's amazing!

00:14:06.613 --> 00:14:07.800
Who casted it?

00:14:08.417 --> 00:14:11.376
There's only one person
in Bow City that can do that.

00:14:11.847 --> 00:14:13.340
It's the Head Instructor.

00:14:13.748 --> 00:14:15.868
But the monsters' entrances
at the school...

00:14:15.994 --> 00:14:17.887
I wanted to send you back.

00:14:17.934 --> 00:14:20.068
But I think I got no choice now.

00:14:20.822 --> 00:14:22.529
-Brother Mo Fan.
-Oh no!

00:14:22.649 --> 00:14:24.090
The entrances here are still intact!

00:14:24.292 --> 00:14:27.251
The One-eyes Wolf monsters
are going for the Head Instructor!

00:14:27.594 --> 00:14:30.034
If the instructors are surrounded,

00:14:30.286 --> 00:14:31.526
everyone will be dead!

00:14:32.274 --> 00:14:34.505
Brother Mo Fan.
What are you thinking about?

00:14:34.667 --> 00:14:35.787
I've said this before.

00:14:35.863 --> 00:14:38.055
If something happened to you,
I don't want to live anymore.

00:14:38.378 --> 00:14:41.134
In the disaster,
nobody can be safe from it.

00:14:41.514 --> 00:14:43.740
Everyone will die in one way or another.

00:14:43.774 --> 00:14:46.199
-We can only try to end this disaster.
-Okay!

00:14:46.392 --> 00:14:47.966
Let's go and end this!

00:14:53.829 --> 00:14:54.989
Thorn-Faced Wolf?

00:14:54.992 --> 00:14:56.712
Why is it here?

00:14:57.217 --> 00:14:59.203
It shouldn't be here.

00:14:59.333 --> 00:15:00.573
Just a little bit more.

00:15:01.138 --> 00:15:02.605
Just a little bit more.

00:15:02.733 --> 00:15:06.040
Why is it here at this time?

00:15:06.903 --> 00:15:08.627
Will we fail our mission now?

00:15:15.976 --> 00:15:18.027
Mo Fan? Why are you here?

00:15:18.127 --> 00:15:20.456
Run! Get out of here!

00:15:20.496 --> 00:15:22.921
Captain! There's no point
in escaping now!

00:15:23.368 --> 00:15:24.728
That's Thorn-Faced Wolf!

00:15:25.074 --> 00:15:28.372
It's impossible for us to win.

00:15:29.170 --> 00:15:30.184
We've failed our mission.

00:15:35.243 --> 00:15:35.976
Mo Fan!

00:15:36.476 --> 00:15:37.699
We haven't fail yet.

00:15:38.344 --> 00:15:39.531
We won't fail!

00:15:41.330 --> 00:15:43.861
This is Bow City! It's my home!

00:15:44.167 --> 00:15:48.584
How can you filthy monsters
just do whatever you like?

00:15:49.328 --> 00:15:51.930
Get out of Bow City now!

00:15:55.110 --> 00:15:56.902
Starchart-level fire magic?

00:15:58.441 --> 00:15:59.521
Is this Fiery Fist?

00:16:21.894 --> 00:16:23.721
The entrance is destroyed!

00:16:23.792 --> 00:16:24.859
We did it.

00:16:25.568 --> 00:16:26.261
Yes.

00:16:27.256 --> 00:16:28.415
We did it.

00:16:28.469 --> 00:16:30.136
Even though I can't kill you, Mo Fan,

00:16:30.884 --> 00:16:33.964
but I will kill you
by destroying Bow City.

00:16:48.673 --> 00:16:49.953
Did everything end?

00:17:05.587 --> 00:17:07.962
♪ Pressing onward courageously ♪

00:17:08.665 --> 00:17:12.075
♪ With the burning dreams in our heart ♪

00:17:12.345 --> 00:17:15.396
♪ We are reminiscing
the dreams of our past ♪

00:17:16.037 --> 00:17:17.517
♪ And it gives me strength ♪

00:17:17.918 --> 00:17:19.811
♪ The most stubborn wings ♪

00:17:20.425 --> 00:17:23.471
♪ Dreamt that we will not
wander anymore ♪

00:17:23.803 --> 00:17:27.728
♪ And hoped that we will
fly further one day ♪

00:17:29.201 --> 00:17:33.126
♪ With the dim lights
shining through the sky ♪

00:17:34.119 --> 00:17:39.066
♪ Shine through our heart
and fill in the ups and downs ♪

00:17:40.127 --> 00:17:43.388
♪ I'm as proud as the sun ♪

00:17:43.700 --> 00:17:46.554
♪ The clouds are moving
in the distance ♪

00:17:46.821 --> 00:17:49.146
♪ Since I have decided to be unique ♪

00:17:49.289 --> 00:17:52.197
♪ I will break all barriers
and shine through ♪

00:17:52.522 --> 00:17:55.244
♪ Life is ever-changing ♪

00:17:55.379 --> 00:17:58.796
♪ But I will soar through the sky ♪

00:17:59.122 --> 00:18:01.091
♪ The hope that is beating within me ♪

00:18:01.663 --> 00:18:04.760
♪ Writes a new chapter for me ♪

00:18:05.305 --> 00:18:09.144
♪ We will battle once more
if we have the chance ♪

00:18:09.732 --> 00:18:15.969
♪ To be the everlasting light
in the world ♪
